msgid "The login block is empty — every page answers 403. Enable at least one of auth.local, auth.discord or auth.breakglass."
msgstr "Le bloc de connexion est vide — chaque page renvoie 403. Activez au moins l'un de auth.local, auth.discord ou auth.breakglass."

